{"id":"adc84a4e20d398f2","group":"73","path":"73/73-df-regular-language-algebra.md","title":"73-df-regular-language-algebra — regular language algebra","display":"73-df-regular-language-algebra — regular language algebra","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Automata Theory, Languages and Computation (Hopcroft, Ullman)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-df-regular-language-algebra","display":"73-df-regular-language-algebra — regular language algebra","depends_on":["[[73-df-finite-words-and-languages]]"],"aliases":["73-df-regular-language-algebra","73-definition-2.2"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Automata Theory, Languages and Computation (Hopcroft, Ullman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-df-regular-language-algebra"},{"key":"display","html":"73-df-regular-language-algebra — regular language algebra"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0a6da8c909717780\" href=\"?note=0a6da8c909717780\" title=\"73-df-finite-words-and-languages\">73-df-finite-words-and-languages</a></span></div>"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-df-regular-language-algebra</span><span>73-definition-2.2</span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma\">\\(\\Sigma\\)</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)\">\\(\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)\\)</span>；有限词、单字符词和拼接见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0a6da8c909717780\" href=\"?note=0a6da8c909717780\" title=\"73-df-finite-words-and-languages\">73-df-finite-words-and-languages</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P(\\Sigma^*)\">\\(\\mathcal P(\\Sigma^*)\\)</span> 的候选子集，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\">\\(A,B\\)</span> 为语言；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RE}(\\Sigma)\">\\(\\mathrm{RE}(\\Sigma)\\)</span> 保留原文的语言代数含义，而非语法树集合。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{RegAlgClosed}_{\\Sigma}\">\\(\\operatorname{RegAlgClosed}_{\\Sigma}\\)</span> 是下述闭包谓词；集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P(\\Sigma^*)\">\\(\\mathcal P(\\Sigma^*)\\)</span> 本身满足该谓词。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}2.2}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{RegAlgClosed}_{\\Sigma}(X)\\leftrightarrow\nX\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\Sigma^*)\\land\\emptyset\\in X\\land\n\\forall a\\in\\Sigma\\;\\{a\\}\\in X\\land\n\\forall A,B\\in X\\;(A\\cup B\\in X\\land A\\cdot B\\in X\\land A^*\\in X)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}2.2}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{RegAlgClosed}_{\\Sigma}(X)\\leftrightarrow\nX\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\Sigma^*)\\land\\emptyset\\in X\\land\n\\forall a\\in\\Sigma\\;\\{a\\}\\in X\\land\n\\forall A,B\\in X\\;(A\\cup B\\in X\\land A\\cdot B\\in X\\land A^*\\in X)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}2.2}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{RE}(\\Sigma)\\coloneqq\n\\bigcap\\{X\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\Sigma^*):\\operatorname{RegAlgClosed}_{\\Sigma}(X)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}2.2}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{RE}(\\Sigma)\\coloneqq\n\\bigcap\\{X\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\Sigma^*):\\operatorname{RegAlgClosed}_{\\Sigma}(X)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原闭包生成元和运算不变。空词语言由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\emptyset^*=\\{\\varepsilon\\}\">\\(\\emptyset^*=\\{\\varepsilon\\}\\)</span> 生成，不另改生成规则。此条目虽曾以“正则表达式”命名，其公式实际定义的是语言集合，故保留该对象。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-finite-words-and-languages","status":"resolved","id":"0a6da8c909717780","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-finite-words-and-languages]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-finite-words-and-languages","status":"resolved","id":"0a6da8c909717780","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"固定 $\\Sigma$ 满足 $\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)$；有限词、单字符词和拼接见 [[73-df-finite-words-and-languages]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)","display":false},{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal P(\\Sigma^*)","display":false},{"tex":"A,B","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RE}(\\Sigma)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{RegAlgClosed}_{\\Sigma}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal P(\\Sigma^*)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}2.2}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{RegAlgClosed}_{\\Sigma}(X)\\leftrightarrow\nX\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\Sigma^*)\\land\\emptyset\\in X\\land\n\\forall a\\in\\Sigma\\;\\{a\\}\\in X\\land\n\\forall A,B\\in X\\;(A\\cup B\\in X\\land A\\cdot B\\in X\\land A^*\\in X)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}2.2}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{RE}(\\Sigma)\\coloneqq\n\\bigcap\\{X\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\Sigma^*):\\operatorname{RegAlgClosed}_{\\Sigma}(X)\\}","display":true},{"tex":"\\emptyset^*=\\{\\varepsilon\\}","display":false}],"bytes":1471,"backlinks":[{"id":"6759b2502900015f","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"此 $\\mathrm{RE}$ 是可识别词语言类，不是 [[73-df-regular-language-algebra]] 中带参数的语言代数 $\\mathrm{RE}(\\Sigma)$；自然数载体实例见 [[73-df-numeric-program-interface]] 的 $\\mathrm{RE}_{\\mathbb N}$。"},{"id":"a3e9105500b60a59","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$E,E_1,E_2\\in\\mathrm{RE}(\\Sigma)$，见 [[73-df-regular-language-algebra]]；在本接口中它们本来就是语言。"},{"id":"a2d140de13ec8897","anchor":"ref-19","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{RE}(\\Sigma)$、$L(E)$ 见 [[73-df-regular-language-algebra]]、[[73-df-regular-algebra-language-map]]；$\\varepsilon\\text{-}\\mathrm{NFA}$ 是 $\\varepsilon\\mathrm{}\\mathrm{NFA}$ 的原排版别名。"},{"id":"a3e9abfe7826975a","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{REGULAR}$、$\\mathrm{RE}(\\Sigma)$、$L(E)$ 分别见 [[73-df-regular-language-notation]]、[[73-df-regular-language-algebra]]、[[73-df-regular-algebra-language-map]]；后两者保持语言代数版本。"}],"outgoing":["0a6da8c909717780"]}